{"id":"26298c14-03ab-44e3-a777-6f2037de6a38","zed":"context","version":"0.4.0","text":"\n\n\n```html next-bound-frontend/src/app/shared/components/sidebar/sidebar.component.html\n<p-sidebar #sidebarRef [(visible)]=\"sidebarVisible\">\n  <ng-template pTemplate=\"headless\">\n    <div class=\"flex flex-column h-full\">\n      <div\n        class=\"flex align-items-center justify-content-between px-4 pt-3 flex-shrink-0\"\n      >\n        <span class=\"inline-flex align-items-center gap-2\">\n          <!-- logo -->\n          <span class=\"font-semibold text-2xl text-primary\">Your Logo</span>\n        </span>\n        <span>\n          <p-button\n            type=\"button\"\n            (onClick)=\"closeCallback($event)\"\n            icon=\"pi pi-times\"\n            rounded=\"true\"\n            outlined=\"true\"\n            styleClass=\"h-2rem w-2rem\"\n          ></p-button>\n        </span>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"overflow-y-auto\">\n        <ul class=\"list-none p-3 m-0\">\n          <li>\n            <div\n              pRipple\n              pStyleClass=\"@next\"\n              enterClass=\"hidden\"\n              enterActiveClass=\"slidedown\"\n              leaveToClass=\"hidden\"\n              leaveActiveClass=\"slideup\"\n              class=\"p-3 flex align-items-center justify-content-between text-600 cursor-pointer p-ripple\"\n            >\n              <span class=\"font-medium\">FAVORITES</span>\n              <i class=\"pi pi-chevron-down\"></i>\n            </div>\n            <ul class=\"list-none p-0 m-0 overflow-hidden\">\n              <li>\n                <a\n                  pRipple\n                  class=\"flex align-items-center cursor-pointer p-3 border-round text-700 hover:surface-100 transition-duration-150 transition-colors p-ripple\"\n                >\n                  <i class=\"pi pi-home mr-2\"></i>\n                  <span class=\"font-medium\">Dashboard</span>\n                </a>\n              </li>\n              <li>\n                <a\n                  pRipple\n                  class=\"flex align-items-center cursor-pointer p-3 border-round text-700 hover:surface-100 transition-duration-150 transition-colors p-ripple\"\n                >\n                  <i class=\"pi pi-bookmark mr-2\"></i>\n                  <span class=\"font-medium\">Bookmarks</span>\n                </a>\n              </li>\n              <li>\n                <a\n                  pRipple\n                  pStyleClass=\"@next\"\n                  enterClass=\"hidden\"\n                  enterActiveClass=\"slidedown\"\n                  leaveToClass=\"hidden\"\n                  leaveActiveClass=\"slideup\"\n                  class=\"flex align-items-center cursor-pointer p-3 border-round text-700 hover:surface-100 transition-duration-150 transition-colors p-ripple\"\n                >\n                  <i class=\"pi pi-chart-line mr-2\"></i>\n                  <span class=\"font-medium\">Reports</span>\n                  <i class=\"pi pi-chevron-down ml-auto\"></i>\n                </a>\n                <ul\n                  class=\"list-none py-0 pl-3 pr-0 m-0 hidden overflow-y-hidden transition-all transition-duration-400 transition-ease-in-out\"\n                >\n                  <li>\n                    <a\n                      pRipple\n                      pStyleClass=\"@next\"\n                      enterClass=\"hidden\"\n                      enterActiveClass=\"slidedown\"\n                      leaveToClass=\"hidden\"\n                      leaveActiveClass=\"slideup\"\n                      class=\"flex align-items-center cursor-pointer p-3 border-round text-700 hover:surface-100 transition-duration-150 transition-colors p-ripple\"\n                    >\n                      <i class=\"pi pi-chart-line mr-2\"></i>\n                      <span class=\"font-medium\">Revenue</span>\n                      <i class=\"pi pi-chevron-down ml-auto\"></i>\n                    </a>\n                    <ul\n                      class=\"list-none py-0 pl-3 pr-0 m-0 hidden overflow-y-hidden transition-all transition-duration-400 transition-ease-in-out\"\n                    >\n                      <li>\n                        <a\n                          pRipple\n                          class=\"flex align-items-center cursor-pointer p-3 border-round text-700 hover:surface-100 transition-duration-150 transition-colors p-ripple\"\n                        >\n                          <i class=\"pi pi-table mr-2\"></i>\n                          <span class=\"font-medium\">View</span>\n                        </a>\n                      </li>\n                      <li>\n                        <a\n                          pRipple\n                          class=\"flex align-items-center cursor-pointer p-3 border-round text-700 hover:surface-100 transition-duration-150 transition-colors p-ripple\"\n                        >\n                          <i class=\"pi pi-search mr-2\"></i>\n                          <span class=\"font-medium\">Search</span>\n                        </a>\n                      </li>\n                    </ul>\n                  </li>\n                  <li>\n                    <a\n                      pRipple\n                      class=\"flex align-items-center cursor-pointer p-3 border-round text-700 hover:surface-100 transition-duration-150 transition-colors p-ripple\"\n                    >\n                      <i class=\"pi pi-chart-line mr-2\"></i>\n                      <span class=\"font-medium\">Expenses</span>\n                    </a>\n                  </li>\n                </ul>\n              </li>\n              <li>\n                <a\n                  pRipple\n                  class=\"flex align-items-center cursor-pointer p-3 border-round text-700 hover:surface-100 transition-duration-150 transition-colors p-ripple\"\n                >\n                  <i class=\"pi pi-users mr-2\"></i>\n                  <span class=\"font-medium\">Team</span>\n                </a>\n              </li>\n              <li>\n                <a\n                  pRipple\n                  class=\"flex align-items-center cursor-pointer p-3 border-round text-700 hover:surface-100 transition-duration-150 transition-colors p-ripple\"\n                >\n                  <i class=\"pi pi-comments mr-2\"></i>\n                  <span class=\"font-medium\">Messages</span>\n                  <span\n                    class=\"inline-flex align-items-center justify-content-center ml-auto bg-primary border-circle\"\n                    style=\"min-width: 1.5rem; height: 1.5rem\"\n                    >3</span\n                  >\n                </a>\n              </li>\n              <li>\n                <a\n                  pRipple\n                  class=\"flex align-items-center cursor-pointer p-3 border-round text-700 hover:surface-100 transition-duration-150 transition-colors p-ripple\"\n                >\n                  <i class=\"pi pi-calendar mr-2\"></i>\n                  <span class=\"font-medium\">Calendar</span>\n                </a>\n              </li>\n              <li>\n                <a\n                  pRipple\n                  class=\"flex align-items-center cursor-pointer p-3 border-round text-700 hover:surface-100 transition-duration-150 transition-colors p-ripple\"\n                >\n                  <i class=\"pi pi-cog mr-2\"></i>\n                  <span class=\"font-medium\">Settings</span>\n                </a>\n              </li>\n            </ul>\n          </li>\n        </ul>\n        <ul class=\"list-none p-3 m-0\">\n          <li>\n            <div\n              pRipple\n              pStyleClass=\"@next\"\n              enterClass=\"hidden\"\n              enterActiveClass=\"slidedown\"\n              leaveToClass=\"hidden\"\n              leaveActiveClass=\"slideup\"\n              class=\"p-3 flex align-items-center justify-content-between text-600 cursor-pointer p-ripple\"\n            >\n              <span class=\"font-medium\">APPLICATION</span>\n              <i class=\"pi pi-chevron-down\"></i>\n            </div>\n            <ul class=\"list-none p-0 m-0 overflow-hidden\">\n              <li>\n                <a\n                  pRipple\n                  class=\"flex align-items-center cursor-pointer p-3 border-round text-700 hover:surface-100 transition-duration-150 transition-colors p-ripple\"\n                >\n                  <i class=\"pi pi-folder mr-2\"></i>\n                  <span class=\"font-medium\">Projects</span>\n                </a>\n              </li>\n              <li>\n                <a\n                  pRipple\n                  class=\"flex align-items-center cursor-pointer p-3 border-round text-700 hover:surface-100 transition-duration-150 transition-colors p-ripple\"\n                >\n                  <i class=\"pi pi-chart-bar mr-2\"></i>\n                  <span class=\"font-medium\">Performance</span>\n                </a>\n              </li>\n              <li>\n                <a\n                  pRipple\n                  class=\"flex align-items-center cursor-pointer p-3 border-round text-700 hover:surface-100 transition-duration-150 transition-colors p-ripple\"\n                >\n                  <i class=\"pi pi-cog mr-2\"></i>\n                  <span class=\"font-medium\">Settings</span>\n                </a>\n              </li>\n            </ul>\n          </li>\n        </ul>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"mt-auto\">\n        <hr class=\"mb-3 mx-3 border-top-1 border-none surface-border\" />\n        <a\n          pRipple\n          class=\"m-3 flex align-items-center cursor-pointer p-3 gap-2 border-round text-700 hover:surface-100 transition-duration-150 transition-colors p-ripple\"\n        >\n          <p-avatar\n            image=\"https://primefaces.org/cdn/primeng/images/demo/avatar/amyelsner.png\"\n            shape=\"circle\"\n          />\n          <span class=\"font-bold\">Amy Elsner</span>\n        </a>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </ng-template>\n</p-sidebar>\n<p-button (onClick)=\"sidebarVisible = true\" icon=\"pi pi-arrow-right\"></p-button>\n```\n\nActualmente este sidemenu es perfecto, así debe funcionar, pero necesito poder construir el menu a partir de un array de objetos, ten presente que hay submenus\nPara construir el menú a partir de un array de objetos, puedes definir una estructura de datos que represente el menú y luego usar *ngFor para iterar sobre estos datos en tu plantilla. Aquí tienes un ejemplo de cómo podrías hacerlo:\n\n1. **Define la estructura del menú en tu componente TypeScript:**\n\n```typescript\n// sidebar.component.ts\nimport { Component } from '@angular/core';\n\ninterface MenuItem {\n  label: string;\n  icon?: string;\n  items?: MenuItem[];\n  badge?: string;\n}\n\n@Component({\n  selector: 'app-sidebar',\n  templateUrl: './sidebar.component.html',\n  styleUrls: ['./sidebar.component.css']\n})\nexport class SidebarComponent {\n  sidebarVisible: boolean = false;\n\n  menuItems: MenuItem[] = [\n    {\n      label: 'FAVORITES',\n      items: [\n        { label: 'Dashboard', icon: 'pi pi-home' },\n        { label: 'Bookmarks', icon: 'pi pi-bookmark' },\n        {\n          label: 'Reports',\n          icon: 'pi pi-chart-line',\n          items: [\n            {\n              label: 'Revenue',\n              icon: 'pi pi-chart-line',\n              items: [\n                { label: 'View', icon: 'pi pi-table' },\n                { label: 'Search', icon: 'pi pi-search' }\n              ]\n            },\n            { label: 'Expenses', icon: 'pi pi-chart-line' }\n          ]\n        },\n        { label: 'Team', icon: 'pi pi-users' },\n        { label: 'Messages', icon: 'pi pi-comments', badge: '3' },\n        { label: 'Calendar', icon: 'pi pi-calendar' },\n        { label: 'Settings', icon: 'pi pi-cog' }\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      label: 'APPLICATION',\n      items: [\n        { label: 'Projects', icon: 'pi pi-folder' },\n        { label: 'Performance', icon: 'pi pi-chart-bar' },\n        { label: 'Settings', icon: 'pi pi-cog' }\n      ]\n    }\n  ];\n\n  closeCallback(event: Event) {\n    this.sidebarVisible = false;\n  }\n}\n```\n\n2. **Itera sobre el array en tu plantilla HTML:**\n\n```html\n<!-- sidebar.component.html -->\n<p-sidebar #sidebarRef [(visible)]=\"sidebarVisible\">\n  <ng-template pTemplate=\"headless\">\n    <div class=\"flex flex-column h-full\">\n      <div class=\"flex align-items-center justify-content-between px-4 pt-3 flex-shrink-0\">\n        <span class=\"inline-flex align-items-center gap-2\">\n          <!-- logo -->\n          <span class=\"font-semibold text-2xl text-primary\">Your Logo</span>\n        </span>\n        <span>\n          <p-button\n            type=\"button\"\n            (onClick)=\"closeCallback($event)\"\n            icon=\"pi pi-times\"\n            rounded=\"true\"\n            outlined=\"true\"\n            styleClass=\"h-2rem w-2rem\"\n          ></p-button>\n        </span>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"overflow-y-auto\">\n        <ul class=\"list-none p-3 m-0\">\n          <li *ngFor=\"let menuItem of menuItems\">\n            <div\n              pRipple\n              pStyleClass=\"@next\"\n              enterClass=\"hidden\"\n              enterActiveClass=\"slidedown\"\n              leaveToClass=\"hidden\"\n              leaveActiveClass=\"slideup\"\n              class=\"p-3 flex align-items-center justify-content-between text-600 cursor-pointer p-ripple\"\n            >\n              <span class=\"font-medium\">{{ menuItem.label }}</span>\n              <i class=\"pi pi-chevron-down\"></i>\n            </div>\n            <ul class=\"list-none p-0 m-0 overflow-hidden\">\n              <ng-container *ngFor=\"let subItem of menuItem.items\">\n                <li *ngIf=\"!subItem.items\">\n                  <a\n                    pRipple\n                    class=\"flex align-items-center cursor-pointer p-3 border-round text-700 hover:surface-100 transition-duration-150 transition-colors p-ripple\"\n                  >\n                    <i [class]=\"subItem.icon + ' mr-2'\"></i>\n                    <span class=\"font-medium\">{{ subItem.label }}</span>\n                    <span\n                      *ngIf=\"subItem.badge\"\n                      class=\"inline-flex align-items-center justify-content-center ml-auto bg-primary border-circle\"\n                      style=\"min-width: 1.5rem; height: 1.5rem\"\n                      >{{ subItem.badge }}</span\n                    >\n                  </a>\n                </li>\n                <li *ngIf=\"subItem.items\">\n                  <a\n                    pRipple\n                    pStyleClass=\"@next\"\n                    enterClass=\"hidden\"\n                    enterActiveClass=\"slidedown\"\n                    leaveToClass=\"hidden\"\n                    leaveActiveClass=\"slideup\"\n                    class=\"flex align-items-center cursor-pointer p-3 border-round text-700 hover:surface-100 transition-duration-150 transition-colors p-ripple\"\n                  >\n                    <i [class]=\"subItem.icon + ' mr-2'\"></i>\n                    <span class=\"font-medium\">{{ subItem.label }}</span>\n                    <i class=\"pi pi-chevron-down ml-auto\"></i>\n                  </a>\n                  <ul\n                    class=\"list-none py-0 pl-3 pr-0 m-0 hidden overflow-y-hidden transition-all transition-duration-400 transition-ease-in-out\"\n                  >\n                    <ng-container *ngFor=\"let subSubItem of subItem.items\">\n                      <li>\n                        <a\n                          pRipple\n                          class=\"flex align-items-center cursor-pointer p-3 border-round text-700 hover:surface-100 transition-duration-150 transition-colors p-ripple\"\n                        >\n                          <i [class]=\"subSubItem.icon + ' mr-2'\"></i>\n                          <span class=\"font-medium\">{{ subSubItem.label }}</span>\n                        </a>\n                      </li>\n                    </ng-container>\n                  </ul>\n                </li>\n              </ng-container>\n            </ul>\n          </li>\n        </ul>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"mt-auto\">\n        <hr class=\"mb-3 mx-3 border-top-1 border-none surface-border\" />\n        <a\n          pRipple\n          class=\"m-3 flex align-items-center cursor-pointer p-3 gap-2 border-round text-700 hover:surface-100 transition-duration-150 transition-colors p-ripple\"\n        >\n          <p-avatar\n            image=\"https://primefaces.org/cdn/primeng/images/demo/avatar/amyelsner.png\"\n            shape=\"circle\"\n          />\n          <span class=\"font-bold\">Amy Elsner</span>\n        </a>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </ng-template>\n</p-sidebar>\n<p-button (onClick)=\"sidebarVisible = true\" icon=\"pi pi-arrow-right\"></p-button>\n```\n\nEn este ejemplo, el menú se construye dinámicamente a partir del array `menuItems`. Cada elemento del menú puede tener subelementos, y estos subelementos también pueden tener sus propios subelementos, lo que permite una estructura de menú anidada.\nExcelente, ahora quiero agregar una funcionalidad, y es qye cuando oprima la combinación de teclas `Command + b` se abra el menú lateral, y si ests abierto, que se cierre\nPara agregar la funcionalidad de abrir y cerrar el menú lateral con la combinación de teclas `Command + b`, puedes usar el evento `keydown` en el componente Angular. Aquí tienes cómo hacerlo:\n\n1. **Escucha el evento `keydown` en el componente:**\n\n```typescript\n// sidebar.component.ts\nimport { Component, HostListener } from '@angular/core';\n\ninterface MenuItem {\n  label: string;\n  icon?: string;\n  items?: MenuItem[];\n  badge?: string;\n}\n\n@Component({\n  selector: 'app-sidebar',\n  templateUrl: './sidebar.component.html',\n  styleUrls: ['./sidebar.component.css']\n})\nexport class SidebarComponent {\n  sidebarVisible: boolean = false;\n\n  menuItems: MenuItem[] = [\n    {\n      label: 'FAVORITES',\n      items: [\n        { label: 'Dashboard', icon: 'pi pi-home' },\n        { label: 'Bookmarks', icon: 'pi pi-bookmark' },\n        {\n          label: 'Reports',\n          icon: 'pi pi-chart-line',\n          items: [\n            {\n              label: 'Revenue',\n              icon: 'pi pi-chart-line',\n              items: [\n                { label: 'View', icon: 'pi pi-table' },\n                { label: 'Search', icon: 'pi pi-search' }\n              ]\n            },\n            { label: 'Expenses', icon: 'pi pi-chart-line' }\n          ]\n        },\n        { label: 'Team', icon: 'pi pi-users' },\n        { label: 'Messages', icon: 'pi pi-comments', badge: '3' },\n        { label: 'Calendar', icon: 'pi pi-calendar' },\n        { label: 'Settings', icon: 'pi pi-cog' }\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      label: 'APPLICATION',\n      items: [\n        { label: 'Projects', icon: 'pi pi-folder' },\n        { label: 'Performance', icon: 'pi pi-chart-bar' },\n        { label: 'Settings', icon: 'pi pi-cog' }\n      ]\n    }\n  ];\n\n  closeCallback(event: Event) {\n    this.sidebarVisible = false;\n  }\n\n  @HostListener('window:keydown', ['$event'])\n  handleKeyboardEvent(event: KeyboardEvent) {\n    if ((event.metaKey || event.ctrlKey) && event.key === 'b') {\n      this.sidebarVisible = !this.sidebarVisible;\n      event.preventDefault(); // Prevent the default action\n    }\n  }\n}\n```\n\n2. **Actualiza la plantilla HTML si es necesario:**\n\nNo necesitas hacer cambios en la plantilla HTML para esta funcionalidad, ya que todo se maneja en el componente TypeScript.\n\n```html\n<!-- sidebar.component.html -->\n<p-sidebar #sidebarRef [(visible)]=\"sidebarVisible\">\n  <ng-template pTemplate=\"headless\">\n    <div class=\"flex flex-column h-full\">\n      <div class=\"flex align-items-center justify-content-between px-4 pt-3 flex-shrink-0\">\n        <span class=\"inline-flex align-items-center gap-2\">\n          <!-- logo -->\n          <span class=\"font-semibold text-2xl text-primary\">Your Logo</span>\n        </span>\n        <span>\n          <p-button\n            type=\"button\"\n            (onClick)=\"closeCallback($event)\"\n            icon=\"pi pi-times\"\n            rounded=\"true\"\n            outlined=\"true\"\n            styleClass=\"h-2rem w-2rem\"\n          ></p-button>\n        </span>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"overflow-y-auto\">\n        <ul class=\"list-none p-3 m-0\">\n          <li *ngFor=\"let menuItem of menuItems\">\n            <div\n              pRipple\n              pStyleClass=\"@next\"\n              enterClass=\"hidden\"\n              enterActiveClass=\"slidedown\"\n              leaveToClass=\"hidden\"\n              leaveActiveClass=\"slideup\"\n              class=\"p-3 flex align-items-center justify-content-between text-600 cursor-pointer p-ripple\"\n            >\n              <span class=\"font-medium\">{{ menuItem.label }}</span>\n              <i class=\"pi pi-chevron-down\"></i>\n            </div>\n            <ul class=\"list-none p-0 m-0 overflow-hidden\">\n              <ng-container *ngFor=\"let subItem of menuItem.items\">\n                <li *ngIf=\"!subItem.items\">\n                  <a\n                    pRipple\n                    class=\"flex align-items-center cursor-pointer p-3 border-round text-700 hover:surface-100 transition-duration-150 transition-colors p-ripple\"\n                  >\n                    <i [class]=\"subItem.icon + ' mr-2'\"></i>\n                    <span class=\"font-medium\">{{ subItem.label }}</span>\n                    <span\n                      *ngIf=\"subItem.badge\"\n                      class=\"inline-flex align-items-center justify-content-center ml-auto bg-primary border-circle\"\n                      style=\"min-width: 1.5rem; height: 1.5rem\"\n                      >{{ subItem.badge }}</span\n                    >\n                  </a>\n                </li>\n                <li *ngIf=\"subItem.items\">\n                  <a\n                    pRipple\n                    pStyleClass=\"@next\"\n                    enterClass=\"hidden\"\n                    enterActiveClass=\"slidedown\"\n                    leaveToClass=\"hidden\"\n                    leaveActiveClass=\"slideup\"\n                    class=\"flex align-items-center cursor-pointer p-3 border-round text-700 hover:surface-100 transition-duration-150 transition-colors p-ripple\"\n                  >\n                    <i [class]=\"subItem.icon + ' mr-2'\"></i>\n                    <span class=\"font-medium\">{{ subItem.label }}</span>\n                    <i class=\"pi pi-chevron-down ml-auto\"></i>\n                  </a>\n                  <ul\n                    class=\"list-none py-0 pl-3 pr-0 m-0 hidden overflow-y-hidden transition-all transition-duration-400 transition-ease-in-out\"\n                  >\n                    <ng-container *ngFor=\"let subSubItem of subItem.items\">\n                      <li>\n                        <a\n                          pRipple\n                          class=\"flex align-items-center cursor-pointer p-3 border-round text-700 hover:surface-100 transition-duration-150 transition-colors p-ripple\"\n                        >\n                          <i [class]=\"subSubItem.icon + ' mr-2'\"></i>\n                          <span class=\"font-medium\">{{ subSubItem.label }}</span>\n                        </a>\n                      </li>\n                    </ng-container>\n                  </ul>\n                </li>\n              </ng-container>\n            </ul>\n          </li>\n        </ul>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"mt-auto\">\n        <hr class=\"mb-3 mx-3 border-top-1 border-none surface-border\" />\n        <a\n          pRipple\n          class=\"m-3 flex align-items-center cursor-pointer p-3 gap-2 border-round text-700 hover:surface-100 transition-duration-150 transition-colors p-ripple\"\n        >\n          <p-avatar\n            image=\"https://primefaces.org/cdn/primeng/images/demo/avatar/amyelsner.png\"\n            shape=\"circle\"\n          />\n          <span class=\"font-bold\">Amy Elsner</span>\n        </a>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </ng-template>\n</p-sidebar>\n<p-button (onClick)=\"sidebarVisible = true\" icon=\"pi pi-arrow-right\"></p-button>\n```\n\nEn este ejemplo, el decorador `@HostListener` se utiliza para escuchar eventos de teclado a nivel de ventana. Cuando se detecta la combinación de teclas `Command + b` (o `Ctrl + b` en Windows/Linux), se alterna la visibilidad del menú lateral (`sidebarVisible`). La llamada a `event.preventDefault()` evita que el navegador realice la acción predeterminada para esa combinación de teclas.\nFunciona perfecto, pero me di cuenta de algo que no quiero que pase, y es que el menu se encutra limitado a 2 submenus, lo que debe suceder es que se renderice de manera dinamica, es decir, que si un submenu tiene mas submenus, estos se rendericen de manera dinamica, sin importar los submenus que sean\nPara hacer que el menú se renderice de manera dinámica y soporte cualquier nivel de submenús, puedes usar una función recursiva en tu plantilla. Esto permitirá que el menú se construya de manera dinámica sin importar cuántos niveles de submenús existan.\n\nAquí tienes cómo hacerlo:\n\n1. **Define la estructura del menú en tu componente TypeScript:**\n\n```typescript\n// sidebar.component.ts\nimport { Component, HostListener } from '@angular/core';\n\ninterface MenuItem {\n  label: string;\n  icon?: string;\n  items?: MenuItem[];\n  badge?: string;\n}\n\n@Component({\n  selector: 'app-sidebar',\n  templateUrl: './sidebar.component.html',\n  styleUrls: ['./sidebar.component.css']\n})\nexport class SidebarComponent {\n  sidebarVisible: boolean = false;\n\n  menuItems: MenuItem[] = [\n    {\n      label: 'FAVORITES',\n      items: [\n        { label: 'Dashboard', icon: 'pi pi-home' },\n        { label: 'Bookmarks', icon: 'pi pi-bookmark' },\n        {\n          label: 'Reports',\n          icon: 'pi pi-chart-line',\n          items: [\n            {\n              label: 'Revenue',\n              icon: 'pi pi-chart-line',\n              items: [\n                { label: 'View', icon: 'pi pi-table' },\n                { label: 'Search', icon: 'pi pi-search' }\n              ]\n            },\n            { label: 'Expenses', icon: 'pi pi-chart-line' }\n          ]\n        },\n        { label: 'Team', icon: 'pi pi-users' },\n        { label: 'Messages', icon: 'pi pi-comments', badge: '3' },\n        { label: 'Calendar', icon: 'pi pi-calendar' },\n        { label: 'Settings', icon: 'pi pi-cog' }\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      label: 'APPLICATION',\n      items: [\n        { label: 'Projects', icon: 'pi pi-folder' },\n        { label: 'Performance', icon: 'pi pi-chart-bar' },\n        { label: 'Settings', icon: 'pi pi-cog' }\n      ]\n    }\n  ];\n\n  closeCallback(event: Event) {\n    this.sidebarVisible = false;\n  }\n\n  @HostListener('window:keydown', ['$event'])\n  handleKeyboardEvent(event: KeyboardEvent) {\n    if ((event.metaKey || event.ctrlKey) && event.key === 'b') {\n      this.sidebarVisible = !this.sidebarVisible;\n      event.preventDefault(); // Prevent the default action\n    }\n  }\n}\n```\n\n2. **Crea una función recursiva en tu plantilla HTML para renderizar el menú dinámicamente:**\n\n```html\n<!-- sidebar.component.html -->\n<p-sidebar #sidebarRef [(visible)]=\"sidebarVisible\">\n  <ng-template pTemplate=\"headless\">\n    <div class=\"flex flex-column h-full\">\n      <div class=\"flex align-items-center justify-content-between px-4 pt-3 flex-shrink-0\">\n        <span class=\"inline-flex align-items-center gap-2\">\n          <!-- logo -->\n          <span class=\"font-semibold text-2xl text-primary\">Your Logo</span>\n        </span>\n        <span>\n          <p-button\n            type=\"button\"\n            (onClick)=\"closeCallback($event)\"\n            icon=\"pi pi-times\"\n            rounded=\"true\"\n            outlined=\"true\"\n            styleClass=\"h-2rem w-2rem\"\n          ></p-button>\n        </span>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"overflow-y-auto\">\n        <ul class=\"list-none p-3 m-0\">\n          <ng-container *ngFor=\"let menuItem of menuItems\">\n            <li>\n              <div\n                pRipple\n                pStyleClass=\"@next\"\n                enterClass=\"hidden\"\n                enterActiveClass=\"slidedown\"\n                leaveToClass=\"hidden\"\n                leaveActiveClass=\"slideup\"\n                class=\"p-3 flex align-items-center justify-content-between text-600 cursor-pointer p-ripple\"\n              >\n                <span class=\"font-medium\">{{ menuItem.label }}</span>\n                <i class=\"pi pi-chevron-down\" *ngIf=\"menuItem.items\"></i>\n              </div>\n              <ul class=\"list-none p-0 m-0 overflow-hidden\">\n                <ng-container *ngTemplateOutlet=\"recursiveList; context: { $implicit: menuItem.items }\"></ng-container>\n              </ul>\n            </li>\n          </ng-container>\n        </ul>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"mt-auto\">\n        <hr class=\"mb-3 mx-3 border-top-1 border-none surface-border\" />\n        <a\n          pRipple\n          class=\"m-3 flex align-items-center cursor-pointer p-3 gap-2 border-round text-700 hover:surface-100 transition-duration-150 transition-colors p-ripple\"\n        >\n          <p-avatar\n            image=\"https://primefaces.org/cdn/primeng/images/demo/avatar/amyelsner.png\"\n            shape=\"circle\"\n          />\n          <span class=\"font-bold\">Amy Elsner</span>\n        </a>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </ng-template>\n</p-sidebar>\n<p-button (onClick)=\"sidebarVisible = true\" icon=\"pi pi-arrow-right\"></p-button>\n\n<ng-template #recursiveList let-items>\n  <ng-container *ngFor=\"let item of items\">\n    <li>\n      <a\n        pRipple\n        pStyleClass=\"@next\"\n        enterClass=\"hidden\"\n        enterActiveClass=\"slidedown\"\n        leaveToClass=\"hidden\"\n        leaveActiveClass=\"slideup\"\n        class=\"flex align-items-center cursor-pointer p-3 border-round text-700 hover:surface-100 transition-duration-150 transition-colors p-ripple\"\n      >\n        <i [class]=\"item.icon + ' mr-2'\" *ngIf=\"item.icon\"></i>\n        <span class=\"font-medium\">{{ item.label }}</span>\n        <i class=\"pi pi-chevron-down ml-auto\" *ngIf=\"item.items\"></i>\n        <span\n          *ngIf=\"item.badge\"\n          class=\"inline-flex align-items-center justify-content-center ml-auto bg-primary border-circle\"\n          style=\"min-width: 1.5rem; height: 1.5rem\"\n          >{{ item.badge }}</span\n        >\n      </a>\n      <ul\n        class=\"list-none py-0 pl-3 pr-0 m-0 hidden overflow-y-hidden transition-all transition-duration-400 transition-ease-in-out\"\n        *ngIf=\"item.items\"\n      >\n        <ng-container *ngTemplateOutlet=\"recursiveList; context: { $implicit: item.items }\"></ng-container>\n      </ul>\n    </li>\n  </ng-container>\n</ng-template>\n```\n\nEn este ejemplo, se utiliza un `ng-template` llamado `recursiveList` para manejar la recursividad. Este `ng-template` se llama recursivamente para cada submenú, lo que permite que el menú se renderice dinámicamente sin importar cuántos niveles de submenús existan.\n\nLa función `*ngTemplateOutlet` se utiliza para insertar el contenido del `ng-template` en el lugar adecuado, pasando el contexto de los elementos del submenú. Esto asegura que cada nivel del menú se renderice correctamente.\n","messages":[{"id":{"replica_id":0,"value":0},"start":0,"metadata":{"role":"user","status":"Done","timestamp":{"replica_id":0,"value":548}}},{"id":{"replica_id":0,"value":63},"start":9905,"metadata":{"role":"assistant","status":"Done","timestamp":{"replica_id":0,"value":549}}},{"id":{"replica_id":0,"value":64},"start":16574,"metadata":{"role":"user","status":"Done","timestamp":{"replica_id":0,"value":550}}},{"id":{"replica_id":0,"value":217},"start":16747,"metadata":{"role":"assistant","status":"Done","timestamp":{"replica_id":0,"value":551}}},{"id":{"replica_id":0,"value":218},"start":23919,"metadata":{"role":"user","status":"Done","timestamp":{"replica_id":0,"value":552}}},{"id":{"replica_id":0,"value":510},"start":24222,"metadata":{"role":"assistant","status":"Done","timestamp":{"replica_id":0,"value":553}}},{"id":{"replica_id":0,"value":511},"start":30555,"metadata":{"role":"user","status":"Done","timestamp":{"replica_id":0,"value":554}}}],"summary":"Dynamic Sidebar Menu from Array","slash_command_output_sections":[{"range":{"start":0,"end":1},"icon":"Library","label":"Default","metadata":null},{"range":{"start":3,"end":9743},"icon":"File","label":"next-bound-frontend/src/app/shared/components/sidebar/sidebar.component.html","metadata":{"path":"next-bound-frontend/src/app/shared/components/sidebar/sidebar.component.html"}}]}